  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758952,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Great Games II - Thing Bounces Back (Commodore 64)\n\nPrepare for a bouncing good time in *Thing Bounces Back*, a quirky and charming platformer for the Commodore 64! You play as a lovable, anthropomorphic ball – simply known as \"Thing\" – on a mission to rescue his captured friends from the clutches of the evil Professor Puff. \n\nThe gameplay revolves around Thing’s unique bouncing abilities. Navigate vibrant, multi-layered levels filled with perilous obstacles, tricky puzzles, and a variety of enemies. Collect power-ups to enhance your bouncing height and attack capabilities, and master the art of strategic rebounds to overcome challenges. \n\n*Thing Bounces Back* boasts bright, cheerful graphics and a catchy soundtrack that perfectly complement the lighthearted and humorous storyline. It's a delightful and accessible game for players of all ages and skill levels, offering a refreshing twist on the classic platformer formula.  A true gem in the 10 Great Games II collection!"
    },
